  "Comment": {
    "type": "cexostring",
    "value": "Pale Master initiation reward (roadmap: pale-master-quest). Modest +3-tier class trinket per the roadmap notes: Lore +3, Spellcraft +3, saving throws vs. death +3, no combat stats. Created by q_pal_finish; one per character (prestigedb stage 3 never resets). The design card's thrall-boost OnEquip mechanic was deferred (interplay with the module's summon_boost.nss OnSpawn system) in favour of this static item."
  },
