  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A flat grey talisman cut from the unadorned stone lid of the twenty-first tomb beneath Bree, hung on a plain cord. It is always cold, and it is heavier than it looks -- the way a closed door is heavier than an open one. Given by Halmir the Grey to those whose names the pale page carries: the dead keep few secrets from the one who wears it, and will find that one harder to claim."
    }
  },
